{"id":"eed77f2564d3480d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-caratheodory-extension.md","title":"Carathéodory Extension","display":"df-caratheodory-extension — Carathéodory Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-caratheodory-extension","aliases":["58-df-caratheodory-extension"],"display":"df-caratheodory-extension — Carathéodory Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-caratheodory-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-caratheodory-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-caratheodory-extension — Carathéodory Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4937f229fe78bb22\" href=\"?note=4937f229fe78bb22\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (底集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\)</span> (outer-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4937f229fe78bb22\" href=\"?note=4937f229fe78bb22\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal M\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal M\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (待定义对象)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CaratheodoryExtension}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{CaratheodoryExtension}_X\\)</span> (本文件定义的构造谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}caratheodory\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CaratheodoryExtension}_X(\\mu^*,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\land\n\\mathcal M=\\{A\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\n(\\mu^*(E)=\\mu^*(E\\cap A)+\\mu^*(E\\setminus A))\\}\n\\land\\mu=\\mu^*\\!\\upharpoonright\\mathcal M\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}caratheodory\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CaratheodoryExtension}_X(\\mu^*,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\land\n\\mathcal M=\\{A\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\n(\\mu^*(E)=\\mu^*(E\\cap A)+\\mu^*(E\\setminus A))\\}\n\\land\\mu=\\mu^*\\!\\upharpoonright\\mathcal M\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Carathéodory 可测集构成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数，且限制测度完备；这些是该构造的定理后果，不是本定义的附加定义式。</li>\n<li>Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra requires additional assumptions for extension.</li>\n<li>Lebesgue measure is obtained via Carathéodory from elementary measure on intervals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"4937f229fe78bb22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"4937f229fe78bb22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)$ (outer-measure predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\mathcal M\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CaratheodoryExtension}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}caratheodory\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CaratheodoryExtension}_X(\\mu^*,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\land\n\\mathcal M=\\{A\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\n(\\mu^*(E)=\\mu^*(E\\cap A)+\\mu^*(E\\setminus A))\\}\n\\land\\mu=\\mu^*\\!\\upharpoonright\\mathcal M\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1307,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-caratheodory-extension.md|58-df-caratheodory-extension]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["4937f229fe78bb22"]}